I hate to say it since it seems like a harsh penalty for forgetting to
unwield it, but the logical thing to happen would be the utter
destruction of the detector, the same way an expensive camera gets
trashed when wielded.  Metal detectors may be a bit more sturdy, so
maybe it should just do minor clubbing damage, maybe d4.

